  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SDG Advoccates and the SDG Strategy Hub</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is implemented with the UN Office of Partnerships represetning the UN.  The project centers around the prioritites of the SDG Advocates - in particular the priorities of the Co-Chairs of the SDG Advocates.  Cooperation will focus on the key SDG moments in the global south, building UNOP&apos;s communication capacity, operationalizing and scaling up the SDG Strategy and Action Hub and joint advocacy.</narrative>
  </description>
